---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---

<Base title="About" description={`About ${SITE.name} — Hobbyist Photographer.`}>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="mb-6 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <!-- TODO: personalize this page — it ships with placeholder copy. -->
      <p>
        Hey, I'm Chengyao, although I go by Edward as my preferred name. I take photos for the fun of it, and for me, most of that fun comes from waiting for the perfect moment as a grand B777 flies by, but I also do other types of photography besides aviation.
      </p>
      <p>
        Curious about how the shot was taken? Each picture (if you hover over it) has the camera/lens and settings written on it. If you want to know how the site works, you can take a look at the source code linked here: 
        <a href={`https://github.com/${SITE.github}/photography-portfolio`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Repo</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        If any of these photos made you stop for a second or you just want to reach out, I'd love to hear form you! You can find most of my contact info on my <a href={`https://github.com/${SITE.github}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
